### E-01 Log emergency event (senior) -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/emergency-events
Authorization: Bearer {{seniorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trigger_type": "semantic_llm",
  "source": "voice_agent",
  "latitude": {{lat}},
  "longitude": {{lng}}
}

### E-01 Emergency linked to a help request
POST {{host}}/api/emergency-events
Authorization: Bearer {{seniorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trigger_type": "acoustic_distress",
  "source": "flutter_app",
  "help_request_id": "{{requestId}}",
  "latitude": {{lat}},
  "longitude": {{lng}}
}

### E-01 Keyword repetition trigger
POST {{host}}/api/emergency-events
Authorization: Bearer {{seniorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trigger_type": "keyword_repetition",
  "source": "voice_agent",
  "detail": {
    "repeated_phrase": "help me help me",
    "times": 5
  }
}

### E-01 Invalid trigger_type -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/emergency-events
Authorization: Bearer {{seniorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trigger_type": "unknown_trigger",
  "source": "voice_agent"
}

### E-01 Role guard: volunteer cannot log emergency -> 403
POST {{host}}/api/emergency-events
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trigger_type": "semantic_llm",
  "source": "flutter_app"
}